<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 29/30.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 29/30.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, May 30 on Thursday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   30.05.97	  29.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5412	    6.5268</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3495	    2.3465</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5686	    4.5750</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4350	    3.4370</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5198	    0.5210</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7787	    0.7785</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2935	    0.2933</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0145	    7.0200</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6935	    0.6937</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2520	    1.2368</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
